# Context-pinned Qwen3-30B-A3B variant for OpenCode.
# Build it with:
#   ollama create qwen-opencode -f models/Modelfile.qwen-opencode
# (The setup scripts build this automatically when WITH_QWEN=1, and
# rewrite the FROM line below to the tag they pulled, so a non-default
# Qwen tag pins itself rather than the default tag named below.)
# Same reasoning as the Flint Modelfile: bake the context in so the
# runtime default cannot silently shrink it. 131072 is both the kit
# default and this model's documented ceiling: Qwen3-30B-A3B is a
# 32,768-native model that reaches 131,072 with YaRN (Qwen model card
# and technical report). Do not raise Qwen past it; the setup scripts
# keep Qwen on QWEN_NUM_CTX (default 131072) even when NUM_CTX raises
# the Flint pin higher.

FROM qwen3:30b-a3b

PARAMETER num_ctx 131072
PARAMETER num_predict 8192
